' Rejected: `kill` — abort branch without a join.
' Same problem as detach (see 06): leaves the branch without a clean
' termination the Scenarios tab can enumerate.
' Rewrite: explicit `stop` / `end` with an `<<error>>` stereotype if
' it represents an abnormal termination — that surfaces in the
' Events tab (SR-121) as an error endpoint.
@startuml
start
:主処理;
if (続行可?) then (yes)
  :後処理;
else (no)
  kill
endif
stop
@enduml
